        {
          "title": "Overview",
          "descriptions": [],
          "contents": [
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "In early 2025, American Fork police contacted Eric Roundy’s family after a neighbor accused his wife of harassment during an ongoing mail-delivery dispute."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "The evidence described in the "
                },
                {
                  "format": "link",
                  "text": "reporting",
                  "url": "https://afcitizen.com/2026/06/18/video-alleges-af-officers-charged-family-for-not-opening-door/"
                },
                {
                  "text": " was limited: the neighbor who called police had not witnessed the conversation and relayed her husband’s account. "
                },
                {
                  "format": "link",
                  "text": "Officer Bronson T. Kitchen",
                  "url": {
                    "$ref": "entity-officer-page-bronson-t-kitchen",
                    "$path": [
                      "url"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": " committed to giving a harassment warning before hearing the Roundy family’s side."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "format": "link",
                  "text": "Body-camera and Ring footage",
                  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aUjH12tPW1A"
                },
                {
                  "text": " show officers "
                },
                {
                  "format": "bold",
                  "text": "repeatedly pounding on the door and calling for the family to come outside."
                },
                {
                  "text": " The family declined to open the door and told the officers to leave, after which they called the Utah County Sheriff’s Office."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "About 14 minutes passed between officers arriving at the door at 10:16 p.m. and speaking with the responding sheriff’s deputy at 10:30 p.m."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "Police mailed "
                },
                {
                  "format": "bold",
                  "text": "disorderly conduct and obstruction citations."
                },
                {
                  "text": " According to the "
                },
                {
                  "format": "link",
                  "text": "American Fork Citizen’s reporting",
                  "url": "https://afcitizen.com/2026/06/18/video-alleges-af-officers-charged-family-for-not-opening-door/"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", investigators and the prosecutor later expressed concerns about pursuing the charges."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "The coverage also raises allegations that city officials contacted Roundy’s employer and sent it records about his communications with the city after he requested public records concerning the encounter."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "formatted-text",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "text": "The collected "
                },
                {
                  "format": "link",
                  "text": "emails and GRAMA appeal correspondence",
                  "url": "/records/citizen-provided/eric-roundy_2025-06_2025-07_grama-appeal-and-related-correspondence.pdf"
                },
                {
                  "text": " document his efforts to obtain records and officials’ internal discussions about his requests."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
